cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Code for: Stromal Remodeling Shapes Osimertinib Response Durability, Resistance Evolution, and Recurrence Risk in EGFR-Mutant NSCLC"
abstract: "Analysis code, figures and tables for the study of stromal remodeling as a determinant of osimertinib response durability, resistance evolution and recurrence risk in EGFR-mutant NSCLC. Combines NanoString GeoMx Digital Spatial Profiling of clinical cohorts (OSIRESP, OSIREAL, H12O TMA004) with cell line RNA-seq data (in-house resistance models and public persistence datasets)."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Peressini Álvarez"
    given-names: "Melina"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/bio2ds-ucm/stromal-remodeling-egfr-nsclc"
url: "https://github.com/bio2ds-ucm/stromal-remodeling-egfr-nsclc"
keywords:
  - NSCLC
  - EGFR
  - osimertinib
  - tumor stroma
  - spatial transcriptomics
  - NanoString GeoMx
  - biomarker discovery
  - drug resistance

 doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22957074"
 date-released: "2026-09-25"

